---
import TitleSection from "./TitleSection.astro";
---

<div class="max-w-lg sm:max-w-2xl xl:max-w-4xl 2xl:max-w-6xl">
  <TitleSection>About</TitleSection>
  <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 xl:text-xl">
    I'm a passionate full-stack developer with over 2 years of experience
    building web applications. I specialize in creating clean, efficient, and
    user-friendly solutions that solve real-world problems.
  </p>
  <p class="text-gray-400 xl:text-xl">
    My journey in web development started when I built my first website at the
    age of 18. Since then, I've been constantly learning and improving my skills
    to stay up-to-date with the latest technologies and best practices.
  </p>
</div>
